  m_Name: InternalCorespondence_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pageNumber: 9
  noteTitle: 'Internal 1/4 Panel Problem:'
  noteContent: "[dean@ans-elblag.pl] \nSubject: Issue with the Exit Panel. From:
    Technical Department To: IT Department. Body: We are reporting a problem with
    the main exit door control panel. It is unresponsive to commands. Is there any
    possibility of a manual override procedure? I heard IT mentioned something about
    this documentation, maybe in the Technicians' room? We don't have the key to
    their office.\n\n[Printed]"
